* Meteoro Amplifier - Pre Power CB150 (Poi 20.60.40.012, rev 0.0, 18/06/2007)
* Netlist SPICE (ngspice) transcrita do esquema original.
* Potenciometros na posicao de 50% indicada no esquema.
* Uso:  ngspice -b meteoro_cb150.cir

*======================== FONTES ========================
* Fonte simetrica +/-55V (C19/C20 4700uF apos ponte KBPC606) - ideal aqui;
* a fonte completa com trafo/ponte esta em fonte.cir
VP55 VP55 0 DC 55
VN55 VN55 0 DC -55

* +/-12V para os op-amps: R88/R20 2K2 2W + zener 1N4742A (12V)
R88 VP55 VP12 2.2k
D1  0 VP12 DZ12
R20 VN12 VN55 2.2k
D2  VN12 0 DZ12
C18 0 VN12 10u

*======================== ENTRADA (J1) ========================
VIN IN 0 DC 0 AC 0.1 SIN(0 0.1 1k)
R1  IN N1 1.5k
C1  N1 IN1P 22n
R2  IN1P 0 220k

*======== CI1A (TL082) - pre com ganho chaveado (CH1) ========
XU1A IN1P IN1N OUT1 VP12 VN12 OPAMP
R4  OUT1 IN1N 22k
C3  OUT1 IN1N 330p
R50 OUT1 N50 47k
C11 N50 IN1N 22n
C2  IN1N N2 10u
R3  N2 N3 2.7k
R13 N3 0 10k
* CH1 fechado curto-circuita R13 (mais ganho). Para CH1 aberto troque por 1G.
RCH1 N3 0 1G

*======================== EQUALIZACAO ========================
* RV2 100KB (agudos)  - extremos A=TONEM / B=TREB, cursor -> C6
C4  OUT1 TREB 2.2n
R6  OUT1 TONEM 12k
RV2a TONEM RV2W 50k
RV2b RV2W TREB 50k
* RV4 50KA (reostato, cursor ligado ao extremo) em paralelo com C5
C5  TONEN TONEM 100n
RV4 TONEN TONEM 7.5k
* R5 2K7 em paralelo com RV3 10KB (reostato) para terra
R5  TONEN 0 2.7k
RV3 TONEN 0 5k
* acoplamento para CI1B
C6  RV2W IN1BP 47n
R7  IN1BP 0 270k

*======== CI1B (TL082) - ganho 1+22k/2k2 = 11 ========
XU1B IN1BP IN1BN OUT2 VP12 VN12 OPAMP
R9  0 N9 2.2k
C8  IN1BN N9 22u
R8  OUT2 IN1BN 22k
C7  OUT2 IN1BN 120p
* rede de presenca: R10 47K || (R12 4K7 + C10 2n2)
R10 OUT2 N10 47k
R12 OUT2 N12 4.7k
C10 N12 N10 2.2n
C9  N10 IN2N 1u

*======== CI2 (TL071) - inversor, RV1 20KB = ganho/master ========
XU2 0 IN2N OUT3 VP12 VN12 OPAMP
RV1 OUT3 IN2N 10k
C13 OUT3 IN2N 330p

*======================== POTENCIA ========================
* entrada do power
R14  OUT3 N14 4.7k
C100 N14 QB1 2.2u
R102 QB1 0 27k
R101 QB1 N101 1k
C101 N101 FB 4.7u
* referencia da fonte de corrente da cauda: zener 9V1 + R100 5K6
R100 VP55 VZ 5.6k
D3   0 VZ DZ9V1
C16  VZ 0 10u
R15  VZ EDIF 3.3k
* par diferencial PNP (MPSA92)
Q1 VAS_B QB1 EDIF MPSA92
Q2 VN55  FB  EDIF MPSA92
* realimentacao: ganho = 1 + 3k3/120 = 28,5x (29 dB)
R17 OUT FB 3.3k
R16 FB N16 120
C12 N16 0 220u
* VAS (BD139) com compensacao Miller C14
R19 VAS_B VN55 560
Q3  VAS VAS_B VN55 BD139
C14 VAS VAS_B 470p
* multiplicador de Vbe (bias) Q8 + RV5 1K
Q8  BIAS_T Q8B VAS MPSA42
R21 BIAS_T RV5T 1.5k
RV5a RV5T Q8B 500
RV5b Q8B RV5B 500
R22 RV5B VAS 680
* bootstrap
R23 BIAS_T NBOOT 2.7k
R24 NBOOT VP55 2.7k
C15 OUT NBOOT 47u
* saida Darlington complementar
Q5 VP55 BIAS_T Q7B BD139
Q7 VP55 Q7B Q7E Q2SC5200
R28 Q7E OUT 0.33
Q4 VN55 VAS Q6B BD140
Q6 VN55 Q6B Q6E Q2SA1943
R27 Q6E OUT 0.33
* Zobel
R26 OUT N26 4.7
C17 N26 0 100n
* line out
R29 OUT LINE 12k
R30 LINE 0 470
C21 LINE LINEOUT 1u
RLINE LINEOUT 0 10k
* alto-falante
RSPK OUT 0 8

*======================== MODELOS ========================
.subckt OPAMP inp inn out vcc vee
* op-amp JFET generico (TL07x): A0=100dB, GBW ~3MHz, saida limitada aos trilhos
Rin inp inn 1T
G1 0 n1 inp inn 1m
R1 n1 0 100Meg
C1 n1 0 53p
B1 n2 0 V = (V(vcc)+V(vee))/2 + ((V(vcc)-V(vee))/2-1.5)*tanh((V(n1)-(V(vcc)+V(vee))/2)/((V(vcc)-V(vee))/2-1.5+1m))
Ro n2 out 50
.ends
.model DZ12  D(Is=1n Rs=5 BV=12  IBV=5m)
.model DZ9V1 D(Is=1n Rs=5 BV=9.1 IBV=5m)
.model MPSA92 PNP(Is=650f Bf=150 Vaf=100 Ikf=0.1 Rb=10 Rc=1 Cjc=10p Cje=50p Tf=500p Tr=10n)
.model MPSA42 NPN(Is=650f Bf=150 Vaf=100 Ikf=0.1 Rb=10 Rc=1 Cjc=6p Cje=50p Tf=500p Tr=10n)
.model BD139 NPN(Is=1e-13 Bf=120 Vaf=100 Ikf=1 Rb=1 Rc=0.1 Re=0.05 Cjc=30p Cje=100p Tf=1n)
.model BD140 PNP(Is=1e-13 Bf=120 Vaf=100 Ikf=1 Rb=1 Rc=0.1 Re=0.05 Cjc=40p Cje=100p Tf=1n)
.model Q2SC5200 NPN(Is=5e-12 Bf=80 Vaf=200 Ikf=6 Rb=2 Rc=0.02 Re=0.01 Cjc=200p Cje=1n Tf=10n)
.model Q2SA1943 PNP(Is=5e-12 Bf=80 Vaf=200 Ikf=6 Rb=2 Rc=0.02 Re=0.01 Cjc=300p Cje=1n Tf=10n)

.options reltol=1e-4
.control
op
echo "=== PONTO DE OPERACAO ==="
print v(vp12) v(vn12) v(vz) v(edif) v(out) v(bias_t)-v(vas)
print (v(q7e)-v(q6e))/0.66 
ac dec 20 10 100k
let g = vdb(out)-vdb(in)
meas ac g1k find g at=1k
wrdata ac_resp.txt vdb(out) vdb(in)
tran 10u 20m
fourier 1k v(out)
meas tran vpk max v(out) from=10m to=20m
wrdata tran_resp.txt v(out) v(in)
.endc
.end
